From: Personal OS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] firewalld: discover iptables during configuration

Docker uses firewalld's direct API even when firewalld uses nftables.
Without iptables in the build sandbox, configure records /bin/false for
its IPv4/IPv6 commands. Keep iptables available at build time and runtime.

diff --git a/elements/gnomeos-deps/firewalld.bst b/elements/gnomeos-deps/firewalld.bst
--- a/elements/gnomeos-deps/firewalld.bst
+++ b/elements/gnomeos-deps/firewalld.bst
@@ -19,2 +19,3 @@ depends:
+- freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/iptables.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/python3-nftables.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/python3.bst
